{"ai_route":{"actual_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","ai_run_id":"airun_20261009172416_e88919a4","expected_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","fallback_chain_id":"aifb_5ea4f96a2ac3d58e79c57dbd","fallback_depth":0,"fallback_reason":"","model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","provider":"mtplx","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","route_base_url":"http://127.0.0.1:8002/v1","route_identity_hash":"c9480819205db8521fec70763515cf905334434da194fa8ae2172b40ab545075","route_profile_id":"independent_ai__mtplx_qwen38_local","thinking":"enabled"},"ai_run_id":"airun_20261009172416_e88919a4","chunk_index":22,"job_id":"mwjob_73665a76584d823bdc7ab8e7","precondition_digest":"3ffd7d1e98990c139aa2d6cbabe6e9a477954c19ec7cf663f4e63eb18dca0f45","project_id":"proj_user_b4858ae428ff","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v10","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_b4858ae428ff_f2ad735441e16008","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_b4858ae428ff_3d4ba466ea36a2ad","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_b4858ae428ff_832ff3424e402ef9"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261009172416_e88919a4","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:revision:4","quote":"安全性终点：TEAE发生率与严重程度（CTCAE 5.0）；生命体征、12导联心电图、临床实验室检查较基线变化；肝酶升高与qt间期延长的特别监测。","quote_sha256":"06515ac1078dcbcf7bd2f61558fc6fffce2a42041de93032bc15aa02cbcfb787","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:r4:6c27867cac9764f5","span_id":"es_safety_endpoint"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:revision:4","quote":"访视策略：筛选（V1）、基线随机（V2）、治疗期第4/8/12周（V3-V5，含发作日记核查与实验室）、安全性随访（V6）；电子日记每日填写，评估窗口±3天。","quote_sha256":"a06c5bfb727d2eed775fcc2c9358264207fc26fc370ac17d2f189dcf4286c897","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:r4:6c27867cac9764f5","span_id":"es_visit_strategy"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:revision:4","quote":"特别关注的不良事件：肝功能异常（ALT/AST>3×ULN伴胆红素升高）；QTcF>500ms或较基线延长>60ms；严重过敏/超敏反应。","quote_sha256":"1d4cf10bbbb48b2944356ffdf4112d6296fd00423d2bc13c456b2bd96c94121b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:r4:6c27867cac9764f5","span_id":"es_special_ae"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:revision:4","quote":"排除标准模块：妊娠或哺乳期；筛选前3个月内使用血管紧张素转换酶抑制剂；存在除HAE外其他原因的血管性水肿（如获得性C1-INH缺乏、ACEI相关水肿）；ALT/AST>2.5×ULN或eGFR<60。","quote_sha256":"22218a8b597d9a870d4c4c95b9e70e33a0c92fce70c70584bdaa31268e8b8c75","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb006498b840cdaaa8e2:r4:6c27867cac9764f5","span_id":"es_exclusion"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_safety_endpoint","es_visit_strategy","es_special_ae","es_exclusion"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"需从项目实验室检查方案或中心实验室合同中获取各访视具体检测项目、采血时间窗及频率","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_lab_panel_list","missing_source_classes":["完整实验室检查项目清单及各访视检测组合"],"target":"14.2节实验室检查项目完整清单"}],"heading":"实验室检查项目","missing_source_classes":["完整实验室检查项目清单及各访视检测组合","采血时间窗与检测频率规范"],"proposal_text":"本研究在筛选期（V1）、基线随机访视（V2）、治疗期第4周（V3）、第8周（V4）、第12周（V5）及安全性随访期（V6）进行临床实验室检查，以评估KZ-HA501的安全性特征。安全性终点涵盖临床实验室检查较基线变化，并对肝酶升高与QT间期延长实施特别监测。特别关注的不良事件包括：肝功能异常（ALT或AST超过3倍正常值上限伴胆红素升高）、QTcF超过500 ms或较基线延长超过60 ms、严重过敏或超敏反应。筛选期实验室检查用于确认入组资格，排除ALT或AST超过2.5倍正常值上限或eGFR低于60 mL/min/1.73m²的受试者。治疗期各访视（V3至V5）的实验室检查与发作日记核查同步实施，评估窗口为计划访视日±3天。具有临床意义的实验室检查值异常若不构成独立疾病或综合征诊断，应在电子病例报告表不良事件页面记录该实验室异常本身，并标明结果高于或低于正常值范围的描述符。各访视具体检测项目清单、采血时间窗及实验室检查频率待完整方案附件确定。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：安全性终点包含临床实验室检查较基线变化及肝酶/QTcF特别监测；V3-V5含实验室检查；排除标准引用ALT/AST>2.5×ULN和eGFR<60；特别关注AE阈值已明确。未确认内容：完整实验室检查项目清单（血常规、生化全套、尿常规、凝血等具体项目）、各访视具体检测组合、采血时间窗、是否每次访视均做全套检查。公司语料中实验室异常记录方式仅作结构参照，不构成本项目已确认规则。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_b4858ae428ff_f2ad735441e16008","section_number":"14.2","source_ids":["protocol